        {
          "text": "Hichi ndicho chivyazi cha Adamu. Mlungu ariphoumba anadamu, waaumba kpwa mfwanowe mwenye. Waumba mlume na mchetu na achiajaliya. Ariphomala kuaumba waaiha anadamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
